---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="Privacy notice for the Coop's Mobile Detailing website and its call, text, and third-party links."
>
  <section class="legal-page section-light">
    <article class="legal-content shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Website privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <div class="legal-alert"><strong>Plain-language summary.</strong><p>This notice describes how the current static website operates. The website does not include forms, accounts, online payments, or booking software.</p></div>
      <h2>Information submitted through this website</h2>
      <p>This static website does not include a contact form, account, payment flow, or booking system. It does not intentionally collect information through a website form.</p>
      <h2>Calling and texting</h2>
      <p>If you choose a call or text link, your device and telecommunications provider handle that communication. Information you send directly to the business may include your phone number, vehicle details, requested service, and service location.</p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>The site may link to Instagram. A third-party service applies its own privacy practices when you leave this website.</p>
      <h2>Analytics and platform services</h2>
      <p>No analytics vendor is active on this website. This notice will be updated before analytics or other data-collecting website services are enabled.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Use the verified phone contact on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for questions about the business. A verified privacy email has not been supplied.</p>
      <p class="legal-footnote">Effective date: October 12, 2026.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
